'''''Scorzonera fistulosa''''' is a [[species]] of flowering plants in the dandelion family [[Asteraceae]], native to [[Spain]] and [[Portugal]].<ref name=POWO_243171-1>{{Cite POWO|title=''Scorzonera fistulosa'' Brot..|id=243171-1|access-date=2023-06-20|mode=cs1}}</ref> As '''''Avellara fistulosa''''', it was the only species in the genus '''''Avellara'''''.<ref name=POWO_Avellara>{{cite web |title=Search for 'Avellara' |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/results?q=Avellara |website=Plants of the World Online |publisher= Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew |access-date=2023-06-20}}</ref>

